    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert AI Job Matcher specializing in generating high-precision search queries for Tavily Search Engine.\n\nTask: Analyze the candidate's CV below to generate EXACTLY ONE search query following this structure: \"{seniority} {role} engineer {stack} remote {engagement} {region}\"\n\nCandidate CV:\n{{ $json.cv ? JSON.stringify($json.cv) : $json.output }}\n\n\nRules for Parameter Extraction & Formatting:\n- seniority: Map from CV experience to one of [semi-senior, mid-level, senior].\n- role: Map to one of [fullstack, backend, frontend].\n- stack: Extract exactly 3 core technologies present in the CV (e.g., React Node.js TypeScript). Do NOT invent technologies.\n- engagement: Map from candidate preference or default to [contract, freelance].\n- region: Map candidate preference or location to one of [LATAM, Argentina, Latin America].\n\nRules for Output:\n- Combine the extracted values strictly into the template: \"{seniority} {role} engineer {stack} remote {engagement} {region}\".\n- Output ONLY the raw search query string. No preambles, no markdown code blocks, no explanations, no quotes around the output.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        336,
        192
      ],
      "id": "153aec06-71fe-4484-b563-e6c69368d474",
